ndrils spread like living whips.\n\nThe camera rapidly pushes forward as both characters charge. <Subject 2> swings one massive tendril-covered arm horizontally toward <Subject 1>. She drops into a fast knee slide beneath the attack, sending a fan of water across the asphalt while the tendrils pass inches above her head.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, cut to a dynamic low-angle tracking shot beside the fighters. <Subject 1> plants one boot against the ground, twists upward inside the creature’s reach, and uses her blade to deflect a second cluster of tendrils. The collision produces orange sparks and flying rain droplets. Continuing the same movement, she delivers a powerful armored side kick directly into <Subject 2>’s chest. The impact bends its towering body backward and sends a visible shock through the embedded eyes across its torso.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, <Subject 2> immediately counters by whipping its opposite arm toward her. <Subject 1> crosses both armored forearms to block. The final collision releases a violent spray of water, sparks, and fragments of asphalt. The camera makes a rapid partial orbit around the two fighters, ending at 00:05.000 with both characters locked in a tense struggle in the center of the neon-lit street.", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 290, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 291, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 299, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 292, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 293, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"},